{
  "apiVersion": "dashboard.grafana.app/v1beta1",
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "document-lab-day-3",
    "annotations": {
      "grafana.app/folder": "grafana-observability-lab"
    }
  },
  "spec": {
    "title": "Document Lab · API-overzicht",
    "tags": [
      "observability-lab",
      "day-3"
    ],
    "timezone": "browser",
    "schemaVersion": 39,
    "refresh": "1m",
    "time": {
      "from": "now-1h",
      "to": "now"
    },
    "templating": {
      "list": []
    },
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "type": "text",
        "title": "Document Lab · API-overzicht",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 24,
          "h": 4
        },
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "**Verkeer · fouten · responstijden** — document-lab / lab\n\nGebaseerd op ontvangen aanvraagtraces; healthchecks tellen niet mee. **4xx** = afgewezen aanvraag, **5xx** = serverfout. Geen traces betekent geen inzicht in API-verkeer. [Bereikbaarheidsdashboard](/d/document-lab-day-1) · Nieuwe demo: `npm run demo:traffic`"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Gemeten aanvragen",
        "description": "Totaal ontvangen SERVER-spans met een HTTP-response in het gekozen tijdvenster. Geen healthchecks; geen schatting van verloren of niet-gesamplede traces.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "tempo",
          "uid": "grafanacloud-traces"
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 4,
          "w": 6,
          "h": 5
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "tempo",
              "uid": "grafanacloud-traces"
            },
            "queryType": "traceql",
            "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"document-lab\" && resource.deployment.environment.name = \"lab\" && kind = server && span.http.response.status_code >= 100 } | count_over_time()",
            "metricsQueryType": "instant",
            "step": "30s",
            "tableType": "traces"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "short",
            "decimals": 0,
            "noValue": "Geen meting",
            "min": 0,
            "color": {
              "mode": "fixed",
              "fixedColor": "blue"
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "colorMode": "value",
          "graphMode": "none"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "HTTP-fouten · 4xx + 5xx",
        "description": "Aandeel antwoorden met HTTP-status >= 400 over het hele gekozen tijdvenster. Inclusief bewust ongeldige demo-invoer. Zonder aanvragen is dit ongedefinieerd.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "tempo",
          "uid": "grafanacloud-traces"
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 6,
          "y": 4,
          "w": 6,
          "h": 5
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "tempo",
              "uid": "grafanacloud-traces"
            },
            "queryType": "traceql",
            "query": "(({ resource.service.name = \"document-lab\" && resource.deployment.environment.name = \"lab\" && kind = server && span.http.response.status_code >= 100 } | count_over_time()) - ({ resource.service.name = \"document-lab\" && resource.deployment.environment.name = \"lab\" && kind = server && span.http.response.status_code >= 100 && span.http.response.status_code < 400 } | count_over_time())) / ({ resource.service.name = \"document-lab\" && resource.deployment.environment.name = \"lab\" && kind = server && span.http.response.status_code >= 100 } | count_over_time())",
            "metricsQueryType": "instant",
            "step": "30s",
            "tableType": "traces"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "percentunit",
            "decimals": 1,
            "noValue": "Geen meting",
            "min": 0,
            "color": {
              "mode": "fixed",
              "fixedColor": "orange"
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "colorMode": "value",
          "graphMode": "none"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Serverfouten · 5xx",
        "description": "Aantal HTTP 5xx-antwoorden in het gekozen tijdvenster. Verbindingsafbrekingen zonder HTTP-response tellen niet mee.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "tempo",
          "uid": "grafanacloud-traces"
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 12,
          "y": 4,
          "w": 6,
          "h": 5
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "tempo",
              "uid": "grafanacloud-traces"
            },
            "queryType": "traceql",
            "query": "({ resource.service.name = \"document-lab\" && resource.deployment.environment.name = \"lab\" && kind = server && span.http.response.status_code >= 100 } | count_over_time()) - ({ resource.service.name = \"document-lab\" && resource.deployment.environment.name = \"lab\" && kind = server && span.http.response.status_code >= 100 && span.http.response.status_code < 500 } | count_over_time())",
            "metricsQueryType": "instant",
            "step": "30s",
            "tableType": "traces"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "short",
            "decimals": 0,
            "noValue": "Geen meting",
            "min": 0,
            "color": {
              "mode": "fixed",
              "fixedColor": "purple"
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "colorMode": "value",
          "graphMode": "none"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Responstijd · p95",
        "description": "Geschatte grens waaronder 95% van de gemeten aanvragen valt, over het hele gekozen tijdvenster. Bij weinig aanvragen geen prestatienulmeting.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "tempo",
          "uid": "grafanacloud-traces"
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 18,
          "y": 4,
          "w": 6,
          "h": 5
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "tempo",
              "uid": "grafanacloud-traces"
            },
            "queryType": "traceql",
            "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"document-lab\" && resource.deployment.environment.name = \"lab\" && kind = server && span.http.response.status_code >= 100 } | quantile_over_time(duration, .95)",
            "metricsQueryType": "instant",
            "step": "30s",
            "tableType": "traces"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "s",
            "decimals": 1,
            "noValue": "Geen meting",
            "min": 0,
            "color": {
              "mode": "fixed",
              "fixedColor": "green"
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "colorMode": "value",
          "graphMode": "none"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Aanvragen per seconde · per HTTP-status",
        "description": "Aantal ontvangen aanvragen per seconde, in intervallen van 30 seconden, uitgesplitst per HTTP-status. Geen gegevens is geen bewijs van bereikbaarheid.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "tempo",
          "uid": "grafanacloud-traces"
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 9,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 9
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "tempo",
              "uid": "grafanacloud-traces"
            },
            "queryType": "traceql",
            "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"document-lab\" && resource.deployment.environment.name = \"lab\" && kind = server && span.http.response.status_code >= 100 } | rate() by (span.http.response.status_code)",
            "metricsQueryType": "range",
            "step": "30s",
            "tableType": "traces"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "reqps",
            "min": 0,
            "custom": {
              "drawStyle": "line",
              "lineWidth": 2,
              "fillOpacity": 10,
              "spanNulls": false,
              "showPoints": "always",
              "pointSize": 4
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "list",
            "placement": "bottom"
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Responstijd · p50 en p95",
        "description": "Geschatte mediaan en p95 per interval van 30 seconden. Lege intervallen worden niet verbonden.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "tempo",
          "uid": "grafanacloud-traces"
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 12,
          "y": 9,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 9
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "tempo",
              "uid": "grafanacloud-traces"
            },
            "queryType": "traceql",
            "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"document-lab\" && resource.deployment.environment.name = \"lab\" && kind = server && span.http.response.status_code >= 100 } | quantile_over_time(duration, .5, .95) > 0",
            "metricsQueryType": "range",
            "step": "30s",
            "tableType": "traces"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "s",
            "min": 0,
            "custom": {
              "drawStyle": "line",
              "lineWidth": 2,
              "fillOpacity": 10,
              "spanNulls": false,
              "showPoints": "always",
              "pointSize": 4
            }
          },
          "overrides": [
            {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "0.5"
              },
              "properties": [
                {
                  "id": "displayName",
                  "value": "p50"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "0.95"
              },
              "properties": [
                {
                  "id": "displayName",
                  "value": "p95"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "list",
            "placement": "bottom"
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Bereikbaarheid · laatste probe",
        "description": "Laatste ontvangen meting: 1 = bereikbaar, 0 = check mislukt. Geen data is onbekend.",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 18,
          "w": 6,
          "h": 5
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "none",
            "noValue": "Geen meting",
            "decimals": 0,
            "mappings": [
              {
                "type": "value",
                "options": {
                  "0": {
                    "text": "FOUT",
                    "color": "red"
                  },
                  "1": {
                    "text": "ONLINE",
                    "color": "green"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "max(probe_success{job=\"document-lab-health\",probe=\"document-lab-local\"})",
            "instant": true,
            "range": false
          }
        ],
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "colorMode": "value",
          "graphMode": "none"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "type": "text",
        "title": "Zo lees je dit dashboard",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 6,
          "y": 18,
          "w": 18,
          "h": 5
        },
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "**p50** is de mediaan; **p95** is de geschatte bovengrens voor 95% van de aanvragen. De bovenste kaarten gebruiken het hele gekozen tijdvenster.\n\n`npm run demo:traffic` doet 40 echte HTTP-aanvragen: 32 geldig en 8 bewust ongeldig (20% HTTP 400). Dit is een demonstratie, geen belastingtest. Grafana kan de traces met vertraging tonen. Sampling, exportverlies of een gestopte API beperken de volledigheid."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
